{"abstract":"On January 10, 2025, the Office of the Federal Register posted for public inspection a Bureau of Industry and Security (BIS) interim final rule: \"Framework for Artificial Intelligence Diffusion\" (RIN 0694-AJ90). This document announces that, on January 15, 2025, BIS will host a virtual public briefing on this rule. This document also provides details on the procedures for participating in the virtual public briefing.","action":"Notification of public briefing on regulatory action.","agencies":[{"raw_name":"DEPARTMENT OF COMMERCE","name":"Commerce Department","id":54,"url":"https://www.federalregister.gov/agencies/commerce-department","json_url":"https://www.federalregister.gov/api/v1/agencies/54","parent_id":null,"slug":"commerce-department"},{"raw_name":"Bureau of Industry and Security","name":"Industry and Security Bureau","id":241,"url":"https://www.federalregister.gov/agencies/industry-and-security-bureau","json_url":"https://www.federalregister.gov/api/v1/agencies/241","parent_id":54,"slug":"industry-and-security-bureau"}],"body_html_url":"https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/full_text/html/2025/01/15/2025-00637.html","cfr_references":[{"chapter":null,"citation_url":null,"part":"732","title":15},{"chapter":null,"citation_url":null,"part":"734","title":15},{"chapter":null,"citation_url":null,"part":"740","title":15},{"chapter":null,"citation_url":null,"part":"742","title":15},{"chapter":null,"citation_url":null,"part":"744","title":15},{"chapter":null,"citation_url":null,"part":"748","title":15},{"chapter":null,"citation_url":null,"part":"750","title":15},{"chapter":null,"citation_url":null,"part":"762","title":15},{"chapter":null,"citation_url":null,"part":"772","title":15},{"chapter":null,"citation_url":null,"part":"774","title":15}],"citation":"90 FR 3624","comment_url":null,"comments_close_on":null,"correction_of":null,"corrections":[],"dates":"Virtual public briefing: The virtual public briefing will be held on January 15, 2025. The publ